  "notes": [
    "This is not a second Tyz config or XP wallet. All purchases/refunds/rank values belong to the existing primary Tyz/MXP design.",
    "Forty event-based Apotheosis affix candidates use their distinct verified rarity milestones. Do not blindly generate 99-level stages for bounded effects or purchase a duplicate attribute affix.",
    "Seven Monk-only Tyz trait candidates have one-time native permission/licenses in the staged tree. Their Tyz numeric effects are not implemented or enabled.",
    "All Monk-only effects require native Monk faction and conventional-equipment eligibility at use-time, not merely at purchase. Global/general Tyz ranks remain available outside Monk.",
    "No Tyz purchase may be allowed without real server-side SkillActionEvent.PurchasePre and RefundPre gate plus direct admin-level reconciliation.",
    "Repeatable universal skill attributes remain owned by primary Tyz; neither this file nor the Monk addon installs all 203 preliminary source endpoints.",
    "Treasure Hand (tmm_monk:harvest_touch) is the ONE combined native unlock for two audited sources: silk_touch and fortune_hands. The Fortune Tyz entry is a bonus rank modifier above the finite native baseline, not an independent toggle node.",
    "Ars Nouveau and Iron's Spellbooks provide Monk ranged attacks; no native Spirit Projectile is registered. Affix conversions into spell effects are source-checked and attributed, not new projectile weapons."
  ],
